    {
      "text": "We have governance and permission checks built into the agent.",
      "approx_timestamp": "31:33"
    },
    {
      "text": "This is essential for governance, for control, for permissions in all of your agents.",
      "approx_timestamp": "36:40"
    },
    {
      "text": "You don't always need to blow away the Claude Code system prompt.",
      "approx_timestamp": "49:57"
    },
    {
