+        <p class="eyebrow">Now available · Volume II · Lesson 11</p>
+        <h2>Building Domain-Specific Agents</h2>
+        <p class="chapter-feature__dek">Control context, model, prompt, and tools in code; climb an eight-agent ladder from Pong to a producer/consumer log system; and learn when not to build custom.</p>
+        <ul class="chapter-feature__meta"><li>Tactic · Build Custom Agents</li><li>90–150 min core lab</li><li>12 full-width course frames</li><li>2 verified practice overlays</li></ul>
+        <a class="button" href="vol-2-ah/11-building-domain-specific-agents.html">Start chapter →</a>
       </div>
