+| Metric | Result |
+|---|---:|
+| Visible chapter words (HTML tags/scripts removed) | 11,119 |
+| Source words (`wc -w`, includes markup labels) | 12,498 |
+| HTML lines | 1,433 |
+| Chapter CSS lines | 354 |
