     <article class="chapter-feature">
       <div class="chapter-feature__copy">
-        <p class="eyebrow">Now available · Volume II · Lesson 10</p>
-        <h2>Seven Levels Agentic Prompt Formats</h2>
-        <p class="chapter-feature__dek">Build reusable prompts from thirteen composable sections, climb seven capability levels, and choose the lowest format that can reliably carry the work.</p>
-        <ul class="chapter-feature__meta"><li>Agentic Horizon · Prompt engineering</li><li>60–90 min lab</li><li>12 full-width course frames</li><li>2 current-practice overlays</li></ul>
-        <a class="button" href="vol-2-ah/10-seven-levels-agentic-prompt-formats.html">Start chapter →</a>
+        <p class="eyebrow">Now available · Volume II · Lesson 11</p>
+        <h2>Building Domain-Specific Agents</h2>
+        <p class="chapter-feature__dek">Control context, model, prompt, and tools in code; climb an eight-agent ladder from Pong to a producer/consumer log system; and learn when not to build custom.</p>
+        <ul class="chapter-feature__meta"><li>Tactic · Build Custom Agents</li><li>90–150 min core lab</li><li>12 full-width course frames</li><li>2 verified practice overlays</li></ul>
